   "profile": {
    "biography": {
     "text": "Bad Bunny is a multi-platinum global recording artist and 7x GRAMMY®️ winner whose genre-defying sound has reshaped contemporary music and culture. Named Spotify’s most-streamed artist worldwide four separate years, becoming the only artist ever to top Spotify’s Global Wrapped list four times. His album &#34;DeBÍ TiRAR MáS FOToS&#34; was also named Spotify’s Global Top Album of that year.\n\n&#34;DeBÍ TiRAR MáS FOToS&#34; became the first fully Spanish-language album to win the GRAMMY®️ Award for Album of the Year, marking a historic milestone for Latin music on the global stage. That same year, he headlined the Super Bowl halftime show, bringing Spanish-language music to one of the largest broadcast audiences in the world.\n\nFrom record-breaking tours and a landmark Puerto Rico residency to redefining what global superstardom looks like, Bad Bunny continues to push boundaries, proving that language, genre and geography are no limitations.",
     "type": "AUTOBIOGRAPHY"
